{"slug":"Universal-Script-Anti-AFKSpy-3540","_id":"62b297fe3f6c8d20fb84dcf6","title":"Anti AFKSpy","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"Reuploaded on Script-Ware Catalogue for more Discovery\n\nAny ROBLOX game can detect when you're not focused on the game client.\n(examples: Group Recruiting Plaza, Teethyz Dentist)\nThis stops that.\n\nThis requires an exploit that can get connections and fire signals.","tags":[],"script":"function disableAllConnections(event:RBXScriptSignal)\n\tlocal a = getconnections(event)\n\tfor _,v in pairs(a) do\n\t\tv:Disable()\n\tend\nend\n\nfiresignal(game:GetService(\"UserInputService\").WindowFocused)\n\nwhile wait() do\n\tdisableAllConnections(game:GetService(\"UserInputService\").WindowFocusReleased)\nend","owner":{"_id":"625cc3ab80cc89dc451f6b96","username":"Dogs","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/625cc3ab80cc89dc451f6b96-1650246665496.png"},"status":"offline","id":"625cc3ab80cc89dc451f6b96","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/625cc3ab80cc89dc451f6b96-1650246665496.png"}},"verified":false,"views":4579,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2022-06-22T04:18:06.047Z","dislikeCount":0,"likeCount":0,"image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-script.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/2373634-1655871486017.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/2373634-1655871486017.jpg"},"executes":181,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p